{"name":"Treasures","hex":"#ba8b36","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Treasures","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["plural of Treasure"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Treasures"}],"entries":[{"title":"Treasures (Dolly Parton album)","blocks":[{"text":"Treasures is the thirty-fourth solo studio album by American singer-songwriter Dolly Parton. It was released on September 24, 1996, by Rising Tide Records and Blue Eye Records. The Steve Buckingham-produced album is made up of covers of rock and country hits from the 1960s, 1970s, and 1980s. It peaked at number 21 on the Billboard Top Country Albums chart and spawned three singles: \"Just When I Needed You Most\", which peaked at number 62 on the Billboard Hot Country Singles chart; a dance remix of \"Peace Train\", which peaked at number seven on the Billboard Hot Dance Music chart; and a dance remix of \"Walking on Sunshine\". The album's release was accompanied by a CBS television special, Dolly Parton: Treasures."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/28/DollyPartonTreasures.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treasures_(Dolly_Parton_album)"},{"title":"Treasures (Tatsuro Yamashita album)","blocks":[{"text":"Treasures  is the compilation album by Japanese singer-songwriter Tatsuro Yamashita, released in November 1995."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/20/Treasures_yamashita.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treasures_(Tatsuro_Yamashita_album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/28/DollyPartonTreasures.jpg/250px-DollyPartonTreasures.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/28/DollyPartonTreasures.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/28/DollyPartonTreasures.jpg/250px-DollyPartonTreasures.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADollyPartonTreasures.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/20/Treasures_yamashita.jpg/250px-Treasures_yamashita.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/20/Treasures_yamashita.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/20/Treasures_yamashita.jpg/250px-Treasures_yamashita.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATreasures_yamashita.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}